  "title": "Clockology Watch Faces",
  "url": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/clockology-watch-faces/id1456386228?uo=4",
  "description": "Create and view beautiful, personalized watch faces on your Apple Watch. With a powerful editor, you can tap into your creative side and design feature-rich watch faces custom-tailored to the information and visuals you want to see. You can also share and import designs from users around the world.\n\nSee beautiful clocks on your nightstand or desk using your iPhone, iPad, or iPod touch. View real-time data from your Apple Watch including steps, distance traveled, activity rings, calendar events, battery level, golden hour timing, and more using HealthKit and system integrations.\n\nClockology supports the following layer types:\n\nVideo and Animations: Play high-speed video and animations with multiple playback triggers\nSound: Play audio with customizable triggers such as on the hour or on tap\nDate & Time: Display time, date, and seconds using a wide variety of fonts and visual effects\nWeather: Show current conditions using Apple Weather, including icons, temperature, and text\nActivity & Health: Use HealthKit integration to display steps, activity goals, and fitness data as rings, bars, or text\nCalendar: Display upcoming events and schedule information from your calendar\nCharts: Visualize your data with dynamic charts and trends for activity, health, and other metrics\nGolden Hour: Display sunrise, sunset, and golden hour timing based on your location\nDevice: Display battery level and other device-specific information\n\nEnd User License Agreement: https://clockologyapp.com/eula/",
